@startuml
title Transfer (to another student OR to an external account) - Business Flow

|Sender|
start
:Select "Transfer";
:Choose transfer type\n1) To another student\n2) To an external account;
:Enter recipient information\n(student ID/QR OR receiving account info)\n+ amount + note;
:Submit request;

|Internal Wallet System|
:Check sender account is active and usable;
:Check sender has enough balance;
:Check transfer rules/limits;

if (Eligible to proceed?) then (Yes)

  if (Transfer type = To another student?) then (Yes)
    :Check recipient is valid and can receive;
    if (Recipient valid?) then (Yes)
      :Move funds to recipient;
      :Confirm transfer completed;
    else (No)
      :Reject transfer;\nProvide reason;
    endif

  else (No)
    :Check receiving information is valid;
    if (Receiving info valid?) then (Yes)
      :Place the amount on hold;
      :Send transfer request to the external payment service;

      |Payment Gateway|
      :Handle the transfer request;
      :Return transfer result\n(approved or rejected);

      |Internal Wallet System|
      if (Approved?) then (Yes)
        :Complete the deduction from sender balance;
        :Confirm transfer completed;
      else (No)
        :Release the held amount;
        :Reject transfer;\nProvide reason;
      endif

    else (No)
      :Reject transfer;\nProvide reason;
    endif
  endif

else (No)
  :Reject transfer;\nProvide reason;
endif

|Sender|
:Receive result;

|Recipient|
if (Transfer type = To another student?) then (Yes)
  :Receive notification of incoming funds;
  :View updated balance/history;
endif

stop
@enduml
